ing the visit. This is a re-cite.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026392275","violation_type_title":"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment (26 TAC §746.3407)","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220912-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2417-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220912","date":"2022-09-12","original_code":"746.2417(1)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-21","finding":"Activities for Infants - Outdoor Play Daily: Staff informed inspector that infants have still not gone outside since the last monitoring visit. This is a re-cite.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026512467","violation_type_title":"Activities for Infants - Outdoor Play Daily (26 TAC §746.2417(1))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":10,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905769985","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905769985","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-08-30","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.3701","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: Inspector observed glass light bulbs in a classroom on a shelf that was accessible to children.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026375263","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3417-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.3417(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Children Handwashing Before Eating: Inspector observed one classroom not washing hands before eating.     Inspector did not see staff sanitizing the diaper changing table after diaper changing.","topic":"sanitation","source_record_id":"1026455213","violation_type_title":"Children Handwashing Before Eating (26 TAC §746.3417(1))","topic_label":"Sanitation & hygiene"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3407","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.3407","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment: The outdoor area had over grown grass, broken toys, ant piles, a broken bench, and a hole through a part of the chain link fence that children can fit through.     One van's AC unit was also not working and there was a small missing panel on the inside of the van.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026375264","violation_type_title":"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment (26 TAC §746.3407)","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-301-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.301(2)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Notification of Change in Space: Inspector observed 7 children in an area that is unlicensed space. The operation had children waiting in the front area of the operation located near the doors until they could go to their classroom.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026415217","violation_type_title":"Notification of Change in Space (26 TAC §746.301(2))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2417-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.2417(1)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Activities for Infants - Outdoor Play Daily: Staff stated all children including infants have not had outdoor play in at least two months.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026335041","violation_type_title":"Activities for Infants - Outdoor Play Daily (26 TAC §746.2417(1))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4501-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.4501(b)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Chairs - Safety Straps Used if Required by Manufacturer: Inspector observed four children in a multi-seated stroller and without properly being strapped in. Three of the four children did not have the straps going over their shoulders properly and one of the four children only had the right strap over his shoulder.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026335042","violation_type_title":"Chairs - Safety Straps Used if Required by Manufacturer (26 TAC §746.4501(b))","topic_label":"Other"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5202-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.5202(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-02","finding":"Emergency Preparedness Plan - Evacuation, relocation, and sheltering/lock-down procedures: The emergency preparedness plan was missing information on how children with limited mobility or who are under 24 months will be evacuated, an address in case of an evacuation, how staff will continue to care for children until parents arrive, and how staff will account for children in their care.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026294557","violation_type_title":"Emergency Preparedness Plan - Evacuation, relocation, and sheltering/lock-down procedures (26 TAC §746.5202(1))","topic_label":"Fire safety & emergency drills"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v8","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3001-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.3001(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Field Trips - Signed Permission: 3 out of 6 children went on a field trip on 8/29/22 and did not have permission to attend.     The operation also did not have permission slips with the required information such as when they were leaving and arriving from their destination.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026415220","violation_type_title":"Field Trips - Signed Permission (26 TAC §746.3001(1))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v9","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4751-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"746.4751(a)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-12","finding":"Maintenance Procedures for Active Play - Inspect Daily: The daily building and grounds checklist has not been documented for most of the 2022 year. Some days in March have check marks, but it is not consistent on a daily basis. In more recent months the daily building and grounds checklist has not been completed at all.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026535421","violation_type_title":"Maintenance Procedures for Active Play - Inspect Daily (26 TAC §746.4751(a))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830-v10","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-621-a-3","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-235039-i20220830","date":"2022-08-30","original_code":"745.621(a)(3)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-01","finding":"AP Initial background checks submitted - At the time you contract with someone who requires a background check: Inspector observed three contracted workers present while children were in care working in different classrooms in the facility prior to having their initial background checks submitted or received. Two of the three contracted workers were also observed in a classroom while having access to children.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026535418","violation_type_title":"AP Initial background checks submitted - At the time you contract with someone who requires a background check (26 TAC §745.621(a)(3))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"}]}],"geo":{"state":{"code":"TX","name":"Texas"},"county":{"fips":"48355","name":"Nueces County"},"zip":"78416","city":"Corpus Christi"},"related":{"same_operator":[],"same_operator_total":0,"same_building":[],"same_address_other_authority":[],"nearby":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1503964","name":"Little Disciples Early Learning Center, LLC","type":"center","city":"Corpus Christi","zip":"78416","capacity":91,"violations":0,"open_violations":0,"status":"licensed","distance_km":0.85},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1512955","name":"Upbring Head Start (Stepping Stone)","type":"center","city":"Corpus Christi","zip":"78415","capacity":31,"violations":2,"open_violations":0,"status":"licensed","distance_km":1.2},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94379","name":"Elgin Park Neighborhood Center","type":"center","city":"Corpus Christi","zip":"78405","capacity":51,"violations":29,"open_violations":0,"status":"licensed","distance_km":1.41},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1507999","name":"Upbring Head Start (Kids of the Neighborhood)","type":"cen